@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #355777
skinparam ActorBorderColor #355777
skinparam ArrowColor #355777
hide footbox
autonumber
title Startup migration with verified snapshot and forward-only upgrade

' Sources relative to repository root:
' backend/entrypoint.sh
' backend/app/migrate.py
' backend/app/migration_backup.py
' backend/migrations/env.py

actor "Service runner / operator" as Operator
participant "Entrypoint / app.migrate" as Migrate
participant Alembic
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "pg_dump / pg_restore" as Tools
participant "Persistent backup directory" as Disk
Operator -> Migrate : Start API container / python -m app.migrate
Migrate -> Alembic : Inspect version graph
break Migration graph does not have exactly one head
  Migrate --> Operator : Fail; API command is not started
end
Migrate -> DB : Connect; acquire application session advisory lock; COMMIT
note right of DB : Serializes PostgreSQL deployment migrations.\nNon-PostgreSQL development skips this advisory lock.
alt Environment is preview or production
  Migrate -> Migrate : Require absolute persistent backup path and PostgreSQL
  Migrate -> Disk : Create / secure backup directory (0700) and partial file
  Migrate -> Tools : pg_dump custom archive; password through environment only
  Tools -> DB : Read consistent database snapshot
  DB --> Tools : Database contents
  Tools -> Disk : Write archive; flush and fsync
  Migrate -> Tools : pg_restore --list partial archive (validation only)
  Tools --> Migrate : Archive validation result
  break Snapshot or verification fails
    Migrate -> Disk : Remove partial file
    Migrate -> DB : Release advisory lock in finally; dispose engine
    Migrate --> Operator : Fail; schema changes blocked; API not started
  end
  Migrate -> Disk : SHA-256; atomically publish verified archive\nWrite checksum sidecar (0600); fsync directory
  Migrate -> Disk : Remove older snapshots past 30 days
  Migrate -> Alembic : Set backup_verified=true and supply locked connection
else Development or test
  Migrate -> Alembic : Supply connection; backup not required
end
Migrate -> Alembic : upgrade(head)
Alembic -> Alembic : Enforce preview / production backup guard
Alembic -> DB : Run pending versioned upgrades in migration transaction
DB --> Alembic : Success or failure
Alembic --> Migrate : Migration result
Migrate -> DB : Release advisory lock in finally; dispose engine
alt Migration succeeded
  Migrate --> Operator : Success
  opt Called from container entrypoint
    Migrate -> Migrate : exec configured API command
  end
else Migration failed
  Migrate --> Operator : Nonzero exit; API command not started
end
note over Migrate : Shipped revisions are immutable. Deployment only upgrades forward.\npg_restore --list inspects the archive; it does not restore a database.
@enduml
